[{"path":"/authors.html","id":null,"dir":"","previous_headings":"","what":"Authors","title":"Authors and Citation","text":"Karl Forner. Author, maintainer, copyright holder.","code":""},{"path":"/authors.html","id":"citation","dir":"","previous_headings":"","what":"Citation","title":"Authors and Citation","text":"Forner K (2025). clitable: Render Tables Text Terminal. R package version 0.1.0, https://github.com/kforner/clitable.","code":"@Manual{,   title = {clitable: Render Tables in Text for the Terminal},   author = {Karl Forner},   year = {2025},   note = {R package version 0.1.0},   url = {https://github.com/kforner/clitable}, }"},{"path":"/index.html","id":"clitable","dir":"","previous_headings":"","what":"Render Tables in Text for the Terminal","title":"Render Tables in Text for the Terminal","text":"aim clitable print tables terminal, using ANSI strings thanks ‘cli’ ‘crayon’ packages use formatting colours.","code":""},{"path":"/index.html","id":"installation","dir":"","previous_headings":"","what":"Installation","title":"Render Tables in Text for the Terminal","text":"Install github:","code":"### using devtools # install devtools from CRAN if needed install.packages('devtools')  install_github('kforner/clitable')  ### or using pak # install pak from CRAN if needed install.packages('pak') pak::pak(\"kforner/clitable\")"},{"path":"/reference/cli_table.html","id":null,"dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"generates a text table — cli_table","title":"generates a text table — cli_table","text":"generates text table","code":""},{"path":"/reference/cli_table.html","id":"ref-usage","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Usage","title":"generates a text table — cli_table","text":"","code":"cli_table(   mat,   header = TRUE,   header_style = NULL,   border_style = \"single\",   heatmap_columns = NULL,   heatmap_colorspace = c(\"green\", \"red\"),   hilite_rows = NULL,   hilite_style = \"bgRed\",   NA_style = NULL,   ... )"},{"path":"/reference/cli_table.html","id":"arguments","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Arguments","title":"generates a text table — cli_table","text":"mat table content print, can data.frame matrix header whether use row names  table headers header_style (crayon) style use print headers (cf crayon::style() border_style style use table borders, one single, double, single-double, double-single, classic heatmap_columns columns displayed heatmaps, vector column indices, names logicals heatmap_colorspace colorspace use heatmaps, passed grDevices::colorRamp() hilite_rows rows highlight, vector column indices, names logicals hilite_style (crayon) style use highlight rows (cf crayon::style() NA_style (crayon) style use highlight NA values (cf crayon::style() ... Arguments passed scale_numeric x numeric vector scale xmin minimum value used scaling. x < xmin set 0 xmax maximum value used scaling. x > xmax set 1","code":""},{"path":"/reference/cli_table.html","id":"value","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Value","title":"generates a text table — cli_table","text":"lines text table ansi_string vector","code":""},{"path":"/reference/cli_table.html","id":"ref-examples","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Examples","title":"generates a text table — cli_table","text":"","code":"df <- head(datasets::penguins, 20)   ct <- cli_table(df, header_style = \"bold\",     NA_style = \"strikethrough\",     heatmap_columns = list(\"flipper_len\"), xmin = 180, xmax = 200,     hilite_rows = !is.na(df$sex) & df$sex == \"female\" & df$bill_dep >= 19,      hilite_style = \"bgGreen\"   )   cat(ct, sep = \"\\n\") #> ┌───────┬─────────┬────────┬────────┬───────────┬─────────┬──────┬────┐ #> │species│ island  │bill_len│bill_dep│flipper_len│body_mass│ sex  │year│ #> ├───────┼─────────┼────────┼────────┼───────────┼─────────┼──────┼────┤ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 39.1   │ 18.7   │ 181       │ 3750    │ male │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 39.5   │ 17.4   │ 186       │ 3800    │female│2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 40.3   │ 18.0   │ 195       │ 3250    │female│2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ NA     │ NA     │ NA        │ NA      │ NA   │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 36.7   │ 19.3   │ 193       │ 3450    │female│2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 39.3   │ 20.6   │ 190       │ 3650    │ male │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 38.9   │ 17.8   │ 181       │ 3625    │female│2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 39.2   │ 19.6   │ 195       │ 4675    │ male │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 34.1   │ 18.1   │ 193       │ 3475    │ NA   │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 42.0   │ 20.2   │ 190       │ 4250    │ NA   │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 37.8   │ 17.1   │ 186       │ 3300    │ NA   │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 37.8   │ 17.3   │ 180       │ 3700    │ NA   │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 41.1   │ 17.6   │ 182       │ 3200    │female│2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 38.6   │ 21.2   │ 191       │ 3800    │ male │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 34.6   │ 21.1   │ 198       │ 4400    │ male │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 36.6   │ 17.8   │ 185       │ 3700    │female│2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 38.7   │ 19.0   │ 195       │ 3450    │female│2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 42.5   │ 20.7   │ 197       │ 4500    │ male │2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 34.4   │ 18.4   │ 184       │ 3325    │female│2007│ #> │ Adelie│Torgersen│ 46.0   │ 21.5   │ 194       │ 4200    │ male │2007│ #> └───────┴─────────┴────────┴────────┴───────────┴─────────┴──────┴────┘"},{"path":"/reference/clitable-package.html","id":null,"dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"clitable: Render Tables in Text for the Terminal — clitable-package","title":"clitable: Render Tables in Text for the Terminal — clitable-package","text":"Render tables text format terminal using ANSI strings thanks 'cli' 'crayon' packages.","code":""},{"path":"/reference/clitable-package.html","id":"features","dir":"Reference","previous_headings":"","what":"Features","title":"clitable: Render Tables in Text for the Terminal — clitable-package","text":"can display 